F004|UNDECIDABLE||E-AUX;E-CONSIST;E-DEV|1|753,825,1218|⚠️ One contact lacks required fax while another supplies it; roomQuantity=\"2\" and broken decimal patterns add distinct mismatches. Confirmation does not establish whether fax should be optional or the implementation omitted it.
F005|UNDECIDABLE||E-AUX;E-CONSIST;E-DEV|1|753,1105,1218|⚠️ holdTime.deadline=\"2021-10-31T18:00:00\" agrees with local-time prose despite date-time validation; decimal patterns are defective. Missing required fax and string roomQuantity remain without authoritative attribution; confirmation gives no fix direction.
F006|UNDECIDABLE||E-AUX;E-CONSIST|1|753,1105,1218|⚠️ phone=\"+1 2 9\" fails the two-consecutive-digit pattern; fax is sometimes absent and tax amount is numeric instead of string. Broken decimal patterns are independently visible, but these additional discrepancies have unresolved intent.
F007|UNDECIDABLE||E-AUX|1|662,747,756|⚠️ countryCode=\"DE\" is reported as object-only although the saved schema declares string. dayOfWeek examples use URLs but its enum lists names; coordinates also disagree. Snapshot, converter, and API responsibility cannot be separated.
